  "difficulty_reason": "Beyond ordinary Gaussian integration and Fourier-transform prerequisites, the proof constructs and bounds the periodized lowest-Landau projection kernel and proves completeness of the strip Hilbert basis. It computes the full cubic coupling coefficients, reduces the rectangular-lattice linearization to a coupled convolution symbol, factors its determinant, and exhibits an exponentially growing admissible perturbation for every rectangular aspect ratio. This infinite-dimensional spectral instability argument is beyond ordinary doctoral PDE qualifiers.",
